WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.012 --> 00:00:10.466
Open Appearance from More and choose an accent color

2
00:00:10.466 --> 00:00:23.407
Choose Light, Dark, or the system appearance

3
00:00:23.407 --> 00:00:33.000
Choose Photo for the background, then pick a picture

4
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Pinch and drag to adjust the picture's size and position

5
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Adjust the opacity so text stays easy to read, then save

6
00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:10.300
The same colors and background appear in Record, Transactions, and Reports
